#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
AWS CLI endpoint coverage runner for Stackyard.

This script executes API operations against a Stackyard endpoint using AWS CLI.
It is designed to surface endpoints that still return NotImplemented and to
separate service-side errors from client-side validation issues.

Highlights:
- Uses AWS CLI for all operation calls.
- Supports explicit include/exclude for services and endpoints.
- Can discover operations from internal *_ops.go catalogs when available.
- Falls back to `aws <service> help` command discovery when no catalog exists.
"""

